    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<h3>Features</h3><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery (Nick)</strong></p><p>When you make the extra attack of the Light property, you can make it as part of the Attack action instead of taking a Bonus Action.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Free Hands</strong></p><p>While wielding this weapon, you can perform the somatic components of spells even while holding both the sword and the shield.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Shield Strike</strong></p><p>While equipped, your shield counts as a Martial Melee weapon that deals [[/r 1d4]] Bludgeoning damage and has the Light property.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Item Prodigy</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p><p>The hallmark of the weapon. You can take the Utilize action (such as drinking a potion, throwing alchemist's fire, or setting a trap) as a Bonus Action. You can do this even while holding both the sword and the shield.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
